$id` `?int` — Default: `null`. `$login` `?string` — Default: `null`. `$avatar` `?string` — Default: `null`. `$wastedTime` `?int` — Default: `null`. `$gender` `?string` — Default: `null`. `$isPro` `?bool` — Default: `null`. `$isDeleted` `?bool` — Default: `null`. `$stats` UserStats — Default: `null`. `$ranks` UserRanks — Default: `null`. `$social` UserSocial — Default: `null`. `$commentsCount` `?int` — Default: `null`. `$commentsRating` `?int` — Default: `null`. `$proPayedTill` `?string` — Default: `null`.","Properties **Description:** API response fields. Built from an array via fromArray(). **Namespace:** `DevCraftClub\\MyShows\\DTO` **Since:** 1.0.0 **See also:** AbstractDto Property Type Description `$id` `?int` — Default: `null`. `$login` `?string` — Default: `null`. `$avatar` `?string` — Default: `null`. `$achievedAt` `?string` — Default: `null`.","Properties **Description:** API response fields. Built from an array via fromArray(). **Namespace:** `DevCraftClub\\MyShows\\DTO` **Since:** 1.0.0 **See also:** AbstractDto Property Type Description `$id` `?int` — Default: `null`. `$login` `?string` — Default: `null`. `$avatar` `?string` — Default: `null`.","Properties **Description:** API response fields. Built from an array via fromArray(). **Namespace:** `DevCraftClub\\MyShows\\DTO` **Since:** 1.0.0 **See also:** AbstractDto Property Type Description `$fiendsPos` `?int` — Default: `null`. `$fiendsTotal` `?int` — Default: `null`.","Properties **Description:** API response fields. Built from an array via fromArray(). **Namespace:** `DevCraftClub\\MyShows\\DTO` **Since:** 1.0.0 **See also:** AbstractDto Enum UserShowStatus Property Type Description `$userId` `?int` — Default: `null`. `$showId` `?int` — Default: `null`. `$status` `?string` — Default: `null`. `$rating` `?int` — Default: `null`. `$rewatched` `?int` — Default: `null`. `$lastEpisodeId` `?int` — Default: `null`. `$lastEpisode` EpisodeSummary — Default: `null`.","Properties **Description:** API response fields. Built from an array via fromArray(). **Namespace:** `DevCraftClub\\MyShows\\DTO` **Since:** 1.0.0 **See also:** AbstractDto Enum UserEpisodeStatus Property Type Description `$userId` `?int` — Default: `null`. `$episodeId` `?int` — Default: `null`. `$showId` `?int` — Default: `null`. `$isChecked` `?bool` — Default: `null`. `$rating` `?int` — Default: `null`. `$watchDate` `?string` — Default: `null`.","Profile IpAuthorization ApiKey DownloadToken Notification Account profile, IP allowlist, API keys, download tokens, and notifications. Do not confuse with DownloadToken.","Profile IpAuthorization ApiKey DownloadToken Notification Аккаунт, allowlist IP, API keys, download-токены и уведомления. См. ProfileRequest. Preferences — не путать с ProxyConfig (plan-level). Allowlisted source IP для доступа к прокси без username/password. См. IpAuthorizationRequest. См. ApiKeyRequest. Не путать с DownloadToken. Time-limited ключ для скачивания proxy list / replaced / activity. См. DownloadTokenRequest. См. NotificationRequest.","Private methods read the token from `MYSHOWS_TOKEN_STORE_PATH`. If the file is missing, obtain it through OAuth2 first. Token refresh and episode check-in: Episode rating is an integer from 0 to 10. If token refresh fails, the stored token is cleared so a stale key is not sent again.","Package overview Capabilities Who it is for Why not hand-rolled helpers Architecture Choosing a base class Requirements Quick start File cache Chainable With DTO from array Guides Documentation sections **DevCraft Dev Tools** (`devcraftclub/dev-tools`) is a small **PHP 8.3** library for common building blocks: chainable `with*` objects, array-backed DTOs with attribute validation, and a filesystem PSR-6 cache. You install it with Composer. There is no DLE plugin UI — it lives in `vendor` and is used from your PHP. In the DevCraft Admin stack it is already a dependency of the admin shell. Version **1.1.0** adds `FileCachePool` on top of the existing `AbstractWith` / `AbstractReflection` toolkit. Chainable `with*` writers via `#[With]` / `#[WithItem]` on `AbstractWith` `get*` / `set*` / `is*` via lombok-php (`#[Getter]` / `#[Setter]`) on the same base class DTOs with public typed properties: `fromArray()`, `toArray()`, `toJson()` on `AbstractReflection` Field rules: `Filter`, `Range`, `Regex`, `ArrayOf` PSR-6 file cache: `FileCachePool`, slash namespaced keys, `clearNamespace()` (Dev Tools extension) **Module / service developers** — pick a base class (or compose `FileCachePool`) and write business types. See guides and API reference. **Site owners / panel admins** — you install DevCraft Admin; Dev Tools arrives as a Composer dependency. You do not configure this library in the browser. Custom setters, ad-hoc array mapping, and one-off file caches diverge across modules. Dev Tools gives one contract for builders, DTOs, and cache. Do **not** merge `AbstractWith` and `AbstractReflection` by inheritance — different property models; use two classes or composition. Need Use Properties Query / builder with `with*` plus `get*` / `set*` extend `AbstractWith` private or protected, non-static, non-readonly API DTO from arrays / to JSON extend `AbstractReflection` public, typed Filesystem PSR-6 cache `new FileCachePool(...)` — PHP 8.3 or newer Composer Runtime: `psr/cache` `^3.0` (PSR-6) Runtime: `marcin-orlowski/lombok-php` `^1.2` (installed with the package) Guide Topic PSR-6 file cache Pool, keys, TTL, clearNamespace With attributes `#[With]`, `#[WithItem]` Getters and setters lombok-php on `AbstractWith` Reflection mapper `fromArray` / nested DTOs Validation Filter, Range, Regex, ArrayOf Packagist and path repository Cache, With, accessors, DTO, validation Classes and attributes What is new in 1.1.0 Полная документация на русском","Methods `validateReceiptIOS(string $receiptData, string $transactionId, bool $isSandbox = true): array` `validateReceiptAndroid(string $payload): array` **Description:** Methods for one API section. **Namespace:** `DevCraftClub\\MyShows\\Repository` **Since:** 1.0.0 **See also:** AbstractRepository **Description:** Calls `iap.ValidateReceiptIOS`. Parameter Type Description `$receiptData` `string` — `$transactionId` `string` — `$isSandbox` `bool` — Default: `true`. **Returns:** `array` **Description:** Calls `iap.ValidateReceiptAndroid`. Parameter Type Description `$payload` `string` — **Returns:** `array`","Methods `toParams(): array` **Description:** Base filter for building request parameters in a chain. **Namespace:** `DevCraftClub\\MyShows\\Filter` **Since:** 1.0.0 **Description:** Return only initialized non-null properties as RPC parameters. **Returns:** `array`","Methods `static wrap(\\Throwable $previous): self` **Description:** SDK error that can be caught on its own. **Namespace:** `DevCraftClub\\Shikimori\\Exception` **Since:** 1.0.0 **See also:** ShikimoriException Parameter Type Description `$previous` `Throwable` — **Returns:** `self`","Methods `static stringKeyed(array $data): array` `static stringOrDefault(array $data, string $key, string $default): string` `static optionalString(array $data, string $key): ?string` `static optionalInt(array $data, string $key): ?int` `static optionalFloat(array $data, string $key): ?float` `static optionalArray(array $data, string $key): ?array` `static optionalListOfMaps(array $data, string $key): ?array` `static optionalDateTime(array $data, string $key): ?DateTimeImmutable` **Description:** SDK helper: client, settings, sign-in, or storage. **Namespace:** `DevCraftClub\\Shikimori\\Util` **Since:** 1.0.0 **Description:** Returns `array<string,`. Parameter Type Description `$data` `array` — **Returns:** `array` Parameter Type Description `$data` `array` — `$key` `string` — `$default` `string` — **Returns:** `string` Parameter Type Description `$data` `array` — `$key` `string` — **Returns:** `?string` Parameter Type Description `$data` `array` — `$key` `string` — **Returns:** `?int` Parameter Type Description `$data` `array